!","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"אנחנו עשויים לישון ביום שבת.","en":"We might sleep on Saturday.","alt":[],"t":"t","audio":"https://d1vq87e9lcf771.cloudfront.net/he_v1/93ab54d39e54904750809d99772424ee"},{"he":"הסכין לא יכולה לחתוך את הדג.","en":"The knife cannot cut the fish.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הוא לא יודע מה אסור ומה מותר.","en":"He does not know what is prohibited and what is allowed.","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"אתה יכול בבקשה לפתוח את החלון?","en":"Can you please open the window?","alt":[],"t":"l"},{"he":"זאת יכולה להיות הרפתקה אמיתית.","en":"This can be a real adventure.","alt":[],"t":"t","inferred":1},{"he":"אמא אומרת שאסור לשחק בתוך הבית.","en":"Mom is saying that it is prohibited to play inside the house.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הנשים חייבות לסגור את הדלת הזאת.","en":"The women must close this door.","alt":[],"t":"t"},{"he":"הסופר שאני אוהב אמור לכתוב ספר חדש.","en":"The writer that I love is supposed to write a new book.","alt":["The writer that I like is supposed to write a new book."],"t":"t"},{"he":"הבוס צריך להרשות לי לעבוד ביום חמישי.","en":"The boss needs to allow me to work on Thursday.","alt":[],"t":"t","inferred":1},{"he":"אמא שואבת ביום ראשון ואבא שואב ביום רביעי.","en":"Mom vacuums on Sunday and Dad vacuums on Wednesday.","alt":[],"t":"t","inferred":1}],"hints":{"מחר":"tomorrow","זה":"it / it is / it's","מותר":"permitted","אפשר":"allowed","ללכת":"go / to go, walk / to walk, go","לאכול":"eat / eating / to eat","אנחנו":"we / we are / we (c.p)","בירושלים":"in Jerusalem","יש":"I have / do you have / has","לה":"her / it (feminine nouns) / she has","טיסה":"a flight / flight","לשתות":"to drink","הרבה":"a lot of / lots of / many","כוס":"a cup / a glass / a glass of juice","קפה":"coffee","שחור":"black / black (m.s)","עשוי":"liable / made / might","להכיל":"to contain, include, comprise","בוטנים":"peanut","אני":"I / I am / I am a girl","יכול":"can / it's possible / maybe","לעזור":"help / helping / to help","לךָ":"to you / you / do you have","הרופאה":"the d